    {
      "id": "bridge-invariants",
      "type": "page-section",
      "label": "Invariants",
      "position": {
        "x": 380,
        "y": -640
      },
      "width": 520,
      "height": 320,
      "data": {
        "title": "Invariants",
        "body": "**What makes this thing a Bridge, specifically?**\n\n- Has a `role`: `import` (this graph consumes the resource) or `export` (this graph offers the resource to whoever pulls it in). A single Bridge node is one or the other, never both — import and export are separate declarations even when they share a `ref`.\n- Has a `resourceKind`: `node-class` (one custom node type), `library` (a bundle; an export of this kind with a class list is read by the create menu, and by nothing else — see Behavior), or `graph` (a whole template graph, treated as one distributed-declaration node).\n- Has a `ref` — the concrete address of what it bridges to.\n- For `resourceKind: node-class`, the granted type key (`target.key` / `_bridge.classKey`) must actually be set. A Bridge with a `ref` but no key grants nothing the validator can see, even though the UI may show it as configured — confirmed live on `templates/page-template/root.node`, where four import bridges had this exact gap until it was fixed 2026-09-23.\n- `grants` name what's permitted over the target (`read`, `create`, `update`, `execute`, `mutate`) — not every grant is meaningful for every `resourceKind`.",
        "presentation": {
          "glyph": {
            "kind": "icon",
            "name": "Article"
          },
          "baseLevel": "detail"
        },
        "definitionKey": "page-section",
        "_classBinding": {
          "key": "page-section",
          "sourceRef": "tlz://twilite.zone/library/templates/page-template/classes/page-section.node-class.node",
          "ref": "tlz://twilite.zone/library/templates/page-template/classes/page-section.node-class.node",
          "identity": {
            "graphId": "page-section-class",
            "name": "Page Section",
            "version": "0.8.1",
            "description": ""
          },
          "intent": "node-class",
          "meaning": "",
          "description": "",
          "defaults": {
            "label": "Page Section",
            "size": {
              "width": 520,
              "height": 320
            },
            "showLabel": false,
            "ports": [
              {
                "id": "root",
                "key": "root",
                "label": "root",
                "direction": "bidirectional",
                "dataType": "any",
