      "width": 520,
      "height": 320,
      "data": {
        "title": "Ports and Relationships",
        "body": "A Bridge states cross-graph authority and participation. Its structural root socket and authored class/resource contract are distinct from a Declaration's presentation Surface chains. Import Bridges own cross-graph event subscriptions; export Bridges expose emitter contracts. A visual workspace connector is derived from participating Bridges, not a new authority record.\n\nPort/handle projections may be materialized by the runtime. Do not infer that every Bridge is unconnected or that a connector line itself persists a grant.",
