    {
      "id": "bridge-examples",
      "type": "page-section",
      "label": "Examples",
      "position": {
        "x": 380,
        "y": 440
      },
      "width": 520,
      "height": 320,
      "data": {
        "title": "Examples",
        "body": "**Examples live outside the primitive, referenced, not embedded.**\n\n- `templates/page-template/root.node` — four import Bridges for its own classes (Masthead, Route, Settings, Section) and one export Bridge for the template, listing all four. A graph that uses it holds a single `resourceKind: graph` Bridge to the template and can create all four.\n- `events/apollo-11.node`'s `event-class-bridge-event` node — a plain, single-class import Bridge with every field populated, worth reading as the minimal correct shape.\n\nThe Page Template is linked from this page.",
